{
  "id": "ebb:demo/locked_door_dialogue",
  "start": "start",
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "旅馆走廊尽头的门框内侧有新鲜刮痕，像是有人用钥匙以外的东西试过。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "knock",
          "type": "action",
          "text": "敲门",
          "next": "knock_reply",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "scope": "player",
              "id": "demo.knocked_locked_door"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "force",
          "type": "action",
          "text": "试着撞开它",
          "check": {
            "attribute": "force",
            "dc": 15,
            "die": "d20",
            "success": "force_success",
            "failure": "force_failure",
            "success_effects": [
              {
                "type": "set_flag",
                "scope": "world",
                "id": "demo.door_forced_success"
              }
            ],
            "failure_effects": [
              {
                "type": "set_flag",
                "scope": "world",
                "id": "demo.door_forced_failure"
              }
            ]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "scope": "world",
              "id": "demo.door_forced_attempted"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "think",
          "type": "thought",
          "text": "门不是为了挡住你，是为了挡住里面的东西。",
          "next": "thought_reply"
        },
        {
          "id": "remember_knock",
          "type": "thought",
          "text": "你刚才敲过门。门记住了，或者你希望它记住了。",
          "next": "knock_memory",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "scope": "player",
              "id": "demo.knocked_locked_door",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "knock_reply": {
      "speaker": "door",
      "text": "木头内部传来短促、空洞的回声。没有脚步声。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "重新考虑。",
          "next": "start"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "type": "action",
          "text": "离开这扇门"
        }
      ]
    },
    "force_success": {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "【检定占位】你的肩膀让门闩发出危险的呻吟。真正的 d20 结果会在下一阶段接入。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "先不要真的撞坏它。",
          "next": "start"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "type": "action",
          "text": "结束互动"
        }
      ]
    },
    "force_failure": {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "你想象了一下失败的声音：肩膀、门、尊严，三者至少会碎一个。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "明智地停下。",
          "next": "start"
        }
      ]
    },
    "thought_reply": {
      "speaker": "inner voice",
      "text": "或者，门只是门。你的脑子强烈反对这个解释。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "thought",
          "text": "继续怀疑。",
          "next": "start"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "type": "action",
          "text": "结束互动"
        }
      ]
    },
    "knock_memory": {
      "speaker": "inner voice",
      "text": "重复的敲门不会制造答案，只会制造节奏。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "thought",
          "text": "回到门前。",
          "next": "start"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
